      "hi": "When getting into bed to sleep.",
      "ur": "When getting into bed to sleep."
    },
    "how": {
      "en": "Count: 1 time.  Dust the bed with the edge of one's garment three times before lying down. Virtue & Benefit: Guarantees divine protection and mercy for the soul during sleep.",
      "hi": "तादाद: 1 time। Dust the bed with the edge of one's garment three times before lying down. फ़ज़ीलत: Guarantees divine protection and mercy for the soul during sleep.",
      "ur": "تعداد: 1 time। Dust the bed with the edge of one's garment three times before lying down. فضیلت: Guarantees divine protection and mercy for the soul during sleep."
    },
