      "hi": "तादाद: 1 time। फ़ज़ीलत: Affirms Allah's absolute sovereignty and seeks the goodness of the upcoming day while seeking protection from sloth, old age, and the torment of the Grave and Fire.",
      "ur": "تعداد: 1 time। فضیلت: Affirms Allah's absolute sovereignty and seeks the goodness of the upcoming day while seeking protection from sloth, old age, and the torment of the Grave and Fire."
