    "lo": {
      "en": "Allahumma Rabban-nas, adhhibil-ba's, ishfi wa Antash-Shafi, la shifa'a illa shifa'uk, shifa'an la yughadiru saqama",
      "hi": "Allahumma Rabban-nas, adhhibil-ba's, ishfi wa Antash-Shafi, la shifa'a illa shifa'uk, shifa'an la yughadiru saqama",
