    "me": {
      "en": "O Allah, Lord of mankind, remove the illness! Heal, for You are the Healer. There is no healing except Your healing—a healing that leaves behind no disease.",
      "hi": "O Allah, Lord of mankind, remove the illness! Heal, for You are the Healer. There is no healing except Your healing—a healing that leaves behind no disease.",
