    "ar": "لَا إِلَٰهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ الْعَظِيمُ الْحَلِيمُ، لَا إِلَٰهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ رَبُّ الْعَرْشِ الْعَظِيمِ، لَا إِلَٰهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ رَبُّ السَّمَاوَاتِ وَرَبُّ الأَرْضِ وَرَبُّ الْعَرْشِ الْكَرِيمِ",
    "lo": {
      "en": "La ilaha illallahul-'Azimul-Halim, la ilaha illallahu Rabbul-'Arshil-'Azim, la ilaha illallahu Rabbus-samawati wa Rabbul-ardi wa Rabbul-'Arshil-Karim",
      "hi": "La ilaha illallahul-'Azimul-Halim, la ilaha illallahu Rabbul-'Arshil-'Azim, la ilaha illallahu Rabbus-samawati wa Rabbul-ardi wa Rabbul-'Arshil-Karim",
      "ur": "La ilaha illallahul-'Azimul-Halim, la ilaha illallahu Rabbul-'Arshil-'Azim, la ilaha illallahu Rabbus-samawati wa Rabbul-ardi wa Rabbul-'Arshil-Karim"
    },
    "me": {
      "en": "There is no deity except Allah, the Tremendous, the Forbearing. There is no deity except Allah, Lord of the Tremendous Throne. There is no deity except Allah, Lord of the heavens, Lord of the earth, and Lord of the Noble Throne.",
      "hi": "There is no deity except Allah, the Tremendous, the Forbearing. There is no deity except Allah, Lord of the Tremendous Throne. There is no deity except Allah, Lord of the heavens, Lord of the earth, and Lord of the Noble Throne.",
