      "hi": "The Prophet ﷺ used to say these words specifically when distressed. फ़ज़ीलत: Re-centers the heart entirely on the supreme majesty of Allah, dispelling overwhelming calamity.",
      "ur": "The Prophet ﷺ used to say these words specifically when distressed. فضیلت: Re-centers the heart entirely on the supreme majesty of Allah, dispelling overwhelming calamity."
