  {
    "id": "dua_v_042",
    "cat": "forgiveness",
    "subcat": "istighfar",
    "allCats": [
      "forgiveness"
    ],
    "ar": "اللَّهُمَّ أَنْتَ رَبِّي لَا إِلٰهَ إِلَّا أَنْتَ، خَلَقْتَنِي وَأَنَا عَبْدُكَ، وَأَنَا عَلَىٰ عَهْدِكَ وَوَعْدِكَ مَا اسْتَطَعْتُ، أَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنْ شَرِّ مَا صَنَعْتُ، أَبُوءُ لَكَ بِنِعْمَتِكَ عَلَيَّ، وَأَبُوءُ بِذَنْبِي، فَاغْفِرْ लِي، فَإِنَّهُ لَا يَغْفِرُ الذُّنُوبَ إِلَّا أَنْتَ",
    "lo": {
      "en": "Allahumma anta Rabbi la ilaha illa Anta, khalaqtani wa ana 'abduka, wa ana 'ala 'ahdika wa wa'dika mastata'tu, a'udhu bika min sharri ma sana'tu, abu'u laka bini'matika 'alayya, wa abu'u bidhanbi, faghfir li, fa innahu la yaghfirudh-dhunuba illa Anta.",
      "hi": "Allahumma anta Rabbi la ilaha illa Anta, khalaqtani wa ana 'abduka, wa ana 'ala 'ahdika wa wa'dika mastata'tu, a'udhu bika min sharri ma sana'tu, abu'u laka bini'matika 'alayya, wa abu'u bidhanbi, faghfir li, fa innahu la yaghfirudh-dhunuba illa Anta.",
      "ur": "Allahumma anta Rabbi la ilaha illa Anta, khalaqtani wa ana 'abduka, wa ana 'ala 'ahdika wa wa'dika mastata'tu, a'udhu bika min sharri ma sana'tu, abu'u laka bini'matika 'alayya, wa abu'u bidhanbi, faghfir li, fa innahu la yaghfirudh-dhunuba illa Anta."
    },
    "me": {
      "en": "O Allah, You are my Lord. There is no deity worthy of worship except You. You created me and I am Your servant. I remain faithful to Your covenant and promise as much as I am able. I seek refuge in You from the evil of what I have done. I acknowledge before You all the blessings You have bestowed upon me, and I confess my sins. So forgive me, for surely no one forgives sins except You.",
      "hi": "O Allah, You are my Lord. There is no deity worthy of worship except You. You created me and I am Your servant. I remain faithful to Your covenant and promise as much as I am able. I seek refuge in You from the evil of what I have done. I acknowledge before You all the blessings You have bestowed upon me, and I confess my sins. So forgive me, for surely no one forgives sins except You.",
      "ur": "O Allah, You are my Lord. There is no deity worthy of worship except You. You created me and I am Your servant. I remain faithful to Your covenant and promise as much as I am able. I seek refuge in You from the evil of what I have done. I acknowledge before You all the blessings You have bestowed upon me, and I confess my sins. So forgive me, for surely no one forgives sins except You."
    },
    "title": {
      "en": "Master Supplication for Forgiveness (Sayyidul Istighfar)",
      "hi": "सैय्यदुल अस्तग़फ़ार (माफ़ी की सबसे बड़ी दुआ)",
      "ur": "سید الاستغفار (توبہ کی افضل دعا)"
    },
    "tm": {
      "en": "Once in the morning (after Fajr) and once in the evening (after Asr/Maghrib).",
      "hi": "सुबह (फ़ज्र के बाद) और शाम (अस्र/मग़रिब के बाद) एक-एक मर्तबा।",
      "ur": "صبح اور شام ایک ایک بار پڑھیں۔"
    },
    "how": {
      "en": "Virtue & Benefit: The Prophet ﷺ said: 'Whoever says it during the day with firm faith and dies before evening will be from the people of Paradise, and whoever says it at night with firm faith and dies before morning will be from the people of Paradise.'",
      "hi": "फ़ज़ीलत: जो शख़्स इसे सुबह के वक़्त यक़ीन के साथ पढ़े और शाम से पहले उसका इंतिक़ाल हो जाए तो वो जन्नतियों में से होगा, और जो रात में पढ़े और सुबह से पहले इंतिक़ाल हो जाए वो भी जन्नती होगा।",
      "ur": "فضیلت: جو شخص صبح یا شام یقین کے ساتھ پڑھے اور وفات پا جائے وہ جنتی ہوگا۔"
    },
    "ref": "Sahih al-Bukhari (6306) | Sahih",
    "active": true
  },
