      "hi": "तादाद: 1 time। Recite upon crossing the doorway. फ़ज़ीलत: The angels declare: 'You are guided, defended, and protected,' and Shaytan moves away from him.",
      "ur": "تعداد: 1 time। Recite upon crossing the doorway. فضیلت: The angels declare: 'You are guided, defended, and protected,' and Shaytan moves away from him."
    },
    "ref": "Sunan Abi Dawud & Jami' at-Tirmidhi (Abu Dawud 5095 / Tirmidhi 3426) | Sahih",
