      "hi": "तादाद: 1 time। Recite as rain begins to descend. फ़ज़ीलत: Supplication at the time of rain is widely answered, and this asks that rain brings blessing rather than destruction.",
      "ur": "تعداد: 1 time। Recite as rain begins to descend. فضیلت: Supplication at the time of rain is widely answered, and this asks that rain brings blessing rather than destruction."
