    "ar": "رَبَّنَا لَا تُؤَاخِذْنَا إِن نَّسِينَا أَوْ أَخْطَأْنَا ۚ رَبَّنَا وَلَا تَحْمِلْ عَلَيْنَا إِصْرًا كَمَا حَمَلْتَهُ عَلَى الَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِنَا ۚ رَبَّنَا وَلَا تُحَمِّلْنَا مَا لَا طَاقَةَ لَنَا بِهِ ۖ وَاعْفُ عَنَّا وَاغْفِرْ لَنَا وَارْحَمْنَا ۚ أَنتَ مَوْلَانَا فَانصُرْنَا عَلَى الْقَوْمِ الْكَافِرِينَ",
    "lo": {
      "en": "Rabbana la tu'akhidhna in nasina aw akhta'na... (complete verse)",
      "hi": "Rabbana la tu'akhidhna in nasina aw akhta'na... (complete verse)",
      "ur": "Rabbana la tu'akhidhna in nasina aw akhta'na... (complete verse)"
    },
    "me": {
      "en": "Our Lord, do not take us to task if we forget or make a mistake. Our Lord, do not lay upon us a burden as You laid upon those before us. Our Lord, do not burden us with what we cannot bear. Pardon us, forgive us, and have mercy upon us. You are our Protector, so grant us victory over the disbelieving people.",
      "hi": "Our Lord, do not take us to task if we forget or make a mistake. Our Lord, do not lay upon us a burden as You laid upon those before us. Our Lord, do not burden us with what we cannot bear. Pardon us, forgive us, and have mercy upon us. You are our Protector, so grant us victory over the disbelieving people.",
