      "ur": "Allahummaqsim lana min khashyatika... wa minal-yaqeeni ma tuhawwinu bihi 'alayna masa'ibad-dunya."
    },
    "me": {
      "en": "O Allah, grant us enough fear of You to keep us away from disobedience, enough obedience to lead us to Paradise, and enough certainty to make the hardships of this world easy for us.",
