      "heart"
    ],
    "ar": "وَأَلَّفَ بَيْنَ قُلُوبِنَا ۚ لَوْ أَنفَقْتَ مَا فِي الْأَرْضِ جَمِيعًا مَّا أَلَّفْتَ بَيْنَ قُلُوبِهِمْ وَلَٰكِنَّ اللَّهَ أَلَّفَ بَيْنَهُمْ ۚ إِنَّهُ عَزِيزٌ حَكِيمٌ",
    "lo": {
      "en": "Wa allafa bayna qulubina. Law anfaqta ma fil-ardi jami'an ma allafta bayna qulubihim walakinnallaha allafa baynahum. Innahu Azizun Hakim.",
      "hi": "Wa allafa bayna qulubina. Law anfaqta ma fil-ardi jami'an ma allafta bayna qulubihim walakinnallaha allafa baynahum. Innahu Azizun Hakim.",
      "ur": "Wa allafa bayna qulubina. Law anfaqta ma fil-ardi jami'an ma allafta bayna qulubihim walakinnallaha allafa baynahum. Innahu Azizun Hakim."
    },
    "me": {
      "en": "And He brought together their hearts. If you had spent all that is on the earth, you could not have brought their hearts together, but Allah brought them together. Indeed, He is Almighty, All-Wise.",
      "hi": "And He brought together their hearts. If you had spent all that is on the earth, you could not have brought their hearts together, but Allah brought them together. Indeed, He is Almighty, All-Wise.",
      "ur": "And He brought together their hearts. If you had spent all that is on the earth, you could not have brought their hearts together, but Allah brought them together. Indeed, He is Almighty, All-Wise."
