      "heart"
    ],
    "ar": "وَيَسْأَلُونَكَ عَنِ الْيَتَامَىٰ ۖ قُلْ إِصْلَاحٌ لَّهُمْ خَيْرٌ ۖ وَإِن تُخَالِطُوهُمْ فَإِخْوَانُكُمْ ۚ وَاللَّهُ يَعْلَمُ الْمُفْسِدَ مِنَ الْمُصْلِحِ ۚ وَلَوْ شَاءَ اللَّهُ لَأَعْنَتَكُمْ ۚ إِنَّ اللَّهَ عَزِيزٌ حَكِيمٌ",
    "lo": {
      "en": "Wa yas'alunaka 'anil-yatama, qul islahun lahum khayr. Wa in tukhalituhum fa ikhwanukum. Wallahu ya'lamul-mufsida minal-muslih. Wa law sha Allahu la a'natakum. Innallaha Azizun Hakim.",
      "hi": "Wa yas'alunaka 'anil-yatama, qul islahun lahum khayr. Wa in tukhalituhum fa ikhwanukum. Wallahu ya'lamul-mufsida minal-muslih. Wa law sha Allahu la a'natakum. Innallaha Azizun Hakim.",
      "ur": "Wa yas'alunaka 'anil-yatama, qul islahun lahum khayr. Wa in tukhalituhum fa ikhwanukum. Wallahu ya'lamul-mufsida minal-muslih. Wa law sha Allahu la a'natakum. Innallaha Azizun Hakim."
    },
    "me": {
      "en": "And they ask you about orphans. Say: Improving their condition is best. And if you mix with them, they are your brothers. Allah knows the one who causes corruption and the one who improves.",
      "hi": "And they ask you about orphans. Say: Improving their condition is best. And if you mix with them, they are your brothers. Allah knows the one who causes corruption and the one who improves.",
      "ur": "And they ask you about orphans. Say: Improving their condition is best. And if you mix with them, they are your brothers. Allah knows the one who causes corruption and the one who improves."
    },
