      "patience"
    ],
    "ar": "اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَسْأَلُكَ الثَّبَاتَ فِي الْأَمْرِ، وَالْعَزِيمَةَ عَلَى الرُّشْدِ، وَأَسْأَلُكَ مُوجِبَاتِ رَحْمَتِكَ، وَعَزَائِمَ مَغْفِرَتِكَ، وَأَسْأَلُكَ شُكْرَ نِعْمَتِكَ، وَحُسْنَ عِبَادَتِكَ، وَأَسْأَلُكَ قَلْبًا سَلِيمًا، وَلِسَانًا صَادِقًا، وَأَسْأَلُكَ مِنْ خَيْرِ مَا تَعْلَمُ، وَأَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنْ شَرِّ مَا تَعْلَمُ، وَأَسْتَغْفِرُكَ لِمَا تَعْلَمُ، إِنَّكَ أَنْتَ عَلَّامُ الْغُيُوبِ",
    "lo": {
      "en": "Allahumma inni as'alukath-thabata fil-amr, wal-'azimata 'alar-rushd, wa as'aluka mujibati rahmatik, wa 'aza'ima maghfiratik, wa as'aluka shukra ni'matik, wa husna 'ibadatik, wa as'aluka qalban saliman, wa lisanan sadiqan, wa as'aluka min khayri ma ta'lam, wa a'udhu bika min sharri ma ta'lam, wa astaghfiruka lima ta'lam, innaka Anta 'Allamul-ghuyub.",
      "hi": "Allahumma inni as'alukath-thabata fil-amr, wal-'azimata 'alar-rushd, wa as'aluka mujibati rahmatik, wa 'aza'ima maghfiratik, wa as'aluka shukra ni'matik, wa husna 'ibadatik, wa as'aluka qalban saliman, wa lisanan sadiqan, wa as'aluka min khayri ma ta'lam, wa a'udhu bika min sharri ma ta'lam, wa astaghfiruka lima ta'lam, innaka Anta 'Allamul-ghuyub.",
      "ur": "Allahumma inni as'alukath-thabata fil-amr, wal-'azimata 'alar-rushd, wa as'aluka mujibati rahmatik, wa 'aza'ima maghfiratik, wa as'aluka shukra ni'matik, wa husna 'ibadatik, wa as'aluka qalban saliman, wa lisanan sadiqan, wa as'aluka min khayri ma ta'lam, wa a'udhu bika min sharri ma ta'lam, wa astaghfiruka lima ta'lam, innaka Anta 'Allamul-ghuyub."
    },
    "me": {
      "en": "O Allah, I ask You for steadfastness in the matter, determination upon right guidance, the means of Your mercy, the certainty of Your forgiveness, gratitude for Your blessings, excellence in worshipping You, a sound heart, a truthful tongue, the best of what You know, protection from the evil You know, and forgiveness for what You know. Indeed, You are the Knower of the unseen.",
      "hi": "O Allah, I ask You for steadfastness in the matter, determination upon right guidance, the means of Your mercy, the certainty of Your forgiveness, gratitude for Your blessings, excellence in worshipping You, a sound heart, a truthful tongue, the best of what You know, protection from the evil You know, and forgiveness for what You know. Indeed, You are the Knower of the unseen.",
      "ur": "O Allah, I ask You for steadfastness in the matter, determination upon right guidance, the means of Your mercy, the certainty of Your forgiveness, gratitude for Your blessings, excellence in worshipping You, a sound heart, a truthful tongue, the best of what You know, protection from the evil You know, and forgiveness for what You know. Indeed, You are the Knower of the unseen."
    },
