    },
    "me": {
      "en": "O Allah, whatever blessing I or any of Your creation have received this morning is from You alone. You have no partner. So all praise and all thanks belong to You.",
      "hi": "O Allah, whatever blessing I or any of Your creation have received this morning is from You alone. You have no partner. So all praise and all thanks belong to You.",
